      <li><img src="/assets/experiments/dither-preset-hard-cut.jpg" alt="The archer in the Hard cut preset: high contrast with a slow boil" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span><b>Hard cut</b>High contrast, slow boil</span></li>
    </ul>
    <figcaption><em>Presets</em>One source image, four presets. Each one is a starting point: every slider stays open.</figcaption>
  </figure>
