      <li><img src="/assets/experiments/dither-look-warm.jpg" alt="The archer as amber grain on a dark brown ground" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span><b>Amber print</b>Diffusion, warm pair</span></li>
      <li><img src="/assets/experiments/dither-look-ember.jpg" alt="The archer as glowing orange dashes on near-black" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span><b>Ember</b>Boil, high glow</span></li>
      <li><img src="/assets/experiments/dither-look-cyan.jpg" alt="The archer as pale cyan shapes on deep navy" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span><b>Night cyan</b>Hard cut, cool pair</span></li>
      <li><img src="/assets/experiments/dither-look-invert.jpg" alt="The archer as black Bayer dots on white paper" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span><b>Paper print</b>Ordered, inverted</span></li>
    </ul>
    <figcaption><em>More looks</em>Same archer, four more combinations of preset, colour pair, glow and invert.</figcaption>
